    "name": "pulse-surveys",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Employee Pulse Surveys",
    "description": "Run short employee pulse surveys with anonymous responses, themes and follow-up actions, plus automations that open an action for low-scoring themes, flag overdue actions and ask HR to review themes when a survey closes.",
